invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_auth.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the chain walk's verdict is dropped when the hello offered a
  ticket, so a server that declines the ticket may present a chain no
  anchor verifies. A declined ticket must get every check a handshake
  with no ticket gets (docs/decisions.md 55); the row that declines under
  an anchor carrying root_p384's Name over another key expects
  unknown_ca and objects.

--- old
    int rc = webpki_verify_chain(list, list_len, cfg, &h->leaf, &h->alert);
    if (rc != CH_OK) {
        return rc;
    }
--- new
    int rc = webpki_verify_chain(list, list_len, cfg, &h->leaf, &h->alert);
    if (rc != CH_OK && cfg->psk == NULL) {
        return rc;
    }
